SUMMARY:Robotics Club
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260506T191500
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260506T200000
UID:69e12bbc4dacf581ff8935e6@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us at the library for a fun forty-five of robotics and co
 ding. Get creative with Snap Circuits\, Dash and Dot\, Sphero Robots and S
 cratch Jr!\nThey will build problem-solving skills while making the robots
  talk\, code\, dance\, and navigate obstacles.\n*Registration not required
 . Space is limited.\nInformation Collection Notice:\nThe personal informat
